WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:07.960
Hey, hey, hey!

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.260
Come back here, André!

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.780
Y-You're terrible!

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.250
You useless dummy!

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:11.610
Ouch!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.190
W-Wait!

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.460
There's an explanation for all of this—

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.140
I don't care about your excuses!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:19.550
You were with our precious Lady.
How dare you let her get involved in a duel?!

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.680
You useless nincompoop! I'll show you!

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.320
Let him off the hook, Nanna.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.420
It wasn't André's fault.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:26.960
Of course it is!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.990
Not only didn't he stop the duel,

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.390
you were struck with a month long
disciplinary confinement because of it!

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:32.850
No matter what anyone says,

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.760
it's all your fault!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.140
That's ridiculous, Grandma!

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:36.730
How am I being ridiculous?!

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.550
You boneheaded dunce!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.670
As punishment, no supper for you!
Now, get in the kitchen closet and stay there!

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.440
Th-That's too cruel!

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.360
Quit talking back and get on with it!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:47.440
Come back here, And—

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:50.440
G-Grandma!

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.160
I'm sure you punished him
enough now, right Nanna?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.200
Please help me prepare for a trip.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:56.540
Prepare for a trip?

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:00.670
This is a good opportunity to visit the Jarjayes
estate in Arras and see how things are.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.730
You mustn't though!

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:06.030
The Master is away, visiting a military
post on the country's border, so...

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.790
First of all, if the palace were to find out you were
away during your disciplinary confinement...

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:11.740
I'm not concerned.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.870
Tell them I went mad from the mental
shock and was admitted to a hospital.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.270
You're putting me in a difficult position!

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.680
There's nothing difficult about it.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:26.220
André, we leave early tomorrow morning,
since the hospital we're staying at is far away.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.380
My blood pressure is acting up again...

